# Leave this unset. In development Vite proxies /api to the backend, and in production your
# host (Vercel) does the same, so the browser only ever talks to its own origin and the
# login cookie stays first-party. Setting it makes the browser call the API cross-origin,
# which breaks login in Safari and with third-party-cookie blocking.
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
